{
  "key": 16414,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_AllLivesTouchOtherLives",
      "en_US": [
        "FRIENDSHIP\r",
        "ALL LIVES\n",
        "TOUCH OTHER\r",
        "LIVES TO CREATE\n",
        "SOMETHING\f",
        "ANEW AND ALIVE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidBarrier",
      "en_US": [
        "A wall of violet light. It hums.\n",
        "It won't let you through."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidCyrusNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Not yet. Something is still\n",
        "feeding it.\r",
        "Find the other lines."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidCyrusItsDown",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: It's down.\r",
        "Someone is in there. Waiting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraAllThree",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: You turned off all three.\r",
        "Do you know how long it took to\n",
        "grow what's on these racks?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraRowansKid",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Rowan's kid. The one from the\n",
        "depot.\r",
        "I told you to go home."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraManWhoWalkedOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: And the man who walked out.\n",
        "Garius told us all about you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidCyrusSilent",
      "en_US": "Cyrus: ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraLate",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: You're late, by the way.\r",
        "Kahn came for his share at dawn.\n",
        "He took what he needs.\r",
        "Palkia's as good as his. This is\n",
        "just what's left."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraSaros",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Saros wanted a morning. He\n",
        "has his clock now.\r",
        "Kahn wants a door. He'll have it\n",
        "soon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraKeepTheDoor",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: And I keep the door. That's\n",
        "all I've ever done."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraHm",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Hm.\r",
        "Still fighting like somebody who's\n",
        "never lost anything."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraWhatStoppedYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: You. You held Dialga and\n",
        "Palkia once. In your world.\r",
        "And something stopped you.\r",
        "What was it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraKeepIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Keep it, then.\r",
        "I'll find it without you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidIndraDontFollow",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Don't follow me. The roof\n",
        "in here doesn't like visitors."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidCyrusLetHerGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Let her go. She isn't the\n",
        "one who has Palkia."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerGone",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: She is gone? ...Of course\n",
        "she is gone.\r",
        "Never mind. I have this."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerRegistry",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The registry. Every card\n",
        "on that wall, copied into a book.\r",
        "Name. Date. Place. And one more\n",
        "column."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerLeftBehind",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The Pokemon they left\n",
        "behind. And where each one went.\r",
        "Kennel, then truck. Every one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerFamilies",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The families came here to\n",
        "remember.\r",
        "Eclipse wrote it all down, and sent\n",
        "their Pokemon to the frames."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerDestroyed",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: And these? Can they be\n",
        "destroyed?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidCyrusRacks",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: These racks pull pain out of\n",
        "something and hold it.\r",
        "Run one backward, and it pushes.\n",
        "Every rack would empty at once.\r",
        "I built machines like these once.\n",
        "I know how they break."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidCyrusSwitchYours",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. The switch is\n",
        "yours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidSwitch",
      "en_US": [
        "The main rack's switch. A dial with\n",
        "an arrow on it.\r",
        "Turn it backward?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidSwitchTurned",
      "en_US": [
        "The main rack's switch. A dial with\n",
        "an arrow on it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidCyrusTakeYourTime",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Take your time. They're not\n",
        "going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidDrained",
      "en_US": [
        "The light runs out of every shard\n",
        "on the racks.\r",
        "They're grey now. Just stones."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidPoketchBuzzes",
      "en_US": "The Poketch buzzes."
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidRuthGone",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: The big reading's gone!\n",
        "It's gone!\r",
        "...But Lake Verity hasn't changed.\n",
        "It's still climbing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerKahnHasEnough",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Then Kahn has enough.\r",
        "We came to buy time. We bought a\n",
        "little. Not enough."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLedgerElias",
      "en_US": [
        "A page in the ledger:\n",
        "ELIAS. VALOR BASIN.\r",
        "In the margin, one letter: I."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLedgerTeo",
      "en_US": [
        "A page near the back:\n",
        "TEO.\r",
        "The place is left blank."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerPolice",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Enough. The International\n",
        "Police are on their way.\r",
        "By tonight, the Sanctuary is ours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidRackLit",
      "en_US": [
        "A rack of violet shards. It hums,\n",
        "and the air around it is warm."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidRackDark",
      "en_US": "They're grey now. Just stones."
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidRubble",
      "en_US": [
        "Rubble fills the hole. The tunnel\n",
        "behind it is gone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom7_Text_RaidLookerSwitch",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The switch is at the main\n",
        "rack, my friend. Cyrus says so."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
